#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Builds the self-contained interactive HTML5 dashboard `stellar_explorer.html`
embedding the full 28-model MESA parameter space dataset (`stellar_grid_data.json`)
and self-contained Three.js (r128 minified) with OrbitControls for 3D Cutaway Onion-Skin visualization.

Milestone M2 Upgrades:
- 3D Cutaway Onion-Skin Model (3/4 cutaway concentric shells Fe/Si/Ne/O/C/He/H)
- Longitudinal cutaway cross-section faces with chemical symbol labels
- Non-linear perceptual radial scaling R(q)
- Dynamic pulsating emissive nuclear burning indicators
- Interactive OrbitControls (damping rotation, wheel zoom, camera presets, reset)
- Raycasting hover inspection with glassmorphism tooltip
- WebGL preserveDrawingBuffer compatibility for PNG exports
"""

